\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces FRFP as a human--AI conversational calculus with five epistemic layers. Interaction protocols constrain admissible H--AI interactions. Epistemic spaces specify the explicit and tacit states those interactions act on. Epistemic algebra equips explicit workflows with compositional structure and a tacit correctness semantics. Epistemic dynamics models how these epistemic states evolve over time and under load, and collective epistemic dynamics lifts the architecture to populations and institutions.}}{9}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
